For clan RGRN I stayed home from work today and ascended my first ever 
character on NAO. The connection dropped 5 times in the middle of the 
afternoon; and lag time on the Astral plane was madness.

All the details are ate
http://alt.org/nethack/dumplog/GaryOlson.lastgame.txt

Salient points:
Found a wand of wishing on the first level of Sokoban. To identify the 
wand, I zapped the wand at a boulder, rock piercer, and floating eye in 
a corrider. Big surprise! Since I already had a bag of holding found 
randomly, now my kit was fairly well set.

Burned a wish on a ring of levitation; and found a ring on the level 
after Medusa. Perseus statue had nothing useful.

One mistake: after I killed the Wizard with a wand of death, I used a 
wand of teleportation to clear monsters out the rest of the tower. Sent 
the Book off to parts unknown and had to track it down with a spell of 
detect treasure.

I entered Astral with one potion of full healing and 5 potions of extra 
healing. Lost all but 2 potions of extra healing to lich frost. Entered 
with two amulets of life saving, used both of them before I got to the 
altar. I was trying to fight it out with Pestilence; then remembered the 
wand of death (8 charges!). Scratch one amulet. I lost the other AoLS to 
network lag. Took too long to figure out a /oPolymorph is the best Lich 
remover.

Whoo! The first altar was the correct altar.

